#: kio/global.cpp:566
msgid ""
"Contact your appropriate computer support system, whether the system "
"administrator, or technical support group for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"Alda yärdäm alu öçen, sistem idäräçe yä ki teräk törkemenä möräçäğät itäse."

#: kio/global.cpp:569
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server for further assistance."
msgstr "Alda yärdäm alu öçen, sistem idäräçegä möräçäğät itäse."

#: kio/global.cpp:572
msgid "Check your access permissions on this resource."
msgstr "Bu resurs öçen üz xoquqların tikşerep alası bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:573
msgid ""
"Your access permissions may be inadequate to perform the requested operation on "
"this resource."
msgstr "Bu çığanaq östennän soralğan eşlätü qılırlıq xoquqlarnıñ citmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:575
msgid ""
"The file may be in use (and thus locked) by another user or application."
msgstr ""
"Bu biremne başqa qullanuçı yä ki yazılım qullanğan (biklängän) buluı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:577
msgid ""
"Check to make sure that no other application or user is using the file or has "
"locked the file."
msgstr ""
"Bu biremne başqa qullanuçı yä ki yazılım qullanğan/biklängän bulmawın tikşerep "
"alası."

#: kio/global.cpp:579
msgid "Although unlikely, a hardware error may have occurred."
msgstr "Cıhaz xatasınıñ kilep çığuı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:581
msgid "You may have encountered a bug in the program."
msgstr "Yazılımnıñ böcäge oçralğandır bu bälki."

#: kio/global.cpp:582
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the program. Please consider "
"submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Yazılımda bet buluınnan çıqqandır bu närsä. Anı açıqlí torğan bet yomğağın "
"tulıraq itep tözep cibärü şäp bulır."

#: kio/global.cpp:584
msgid ""
"Update your software to the latest version. Your distribution should provide "
"tools to update your software."
msgstr ""
"Yazılımnı soñğı söremenä yañartası bar. Yazılım yañarta torğan ayırım qorallar "
"bulırğa tieş."

#: kio/global.cpp:586
msgid ""
"When all else fails, please consider helping the KDE team or the third party "
"maintainer of this software by submitting a high quality bug report. If the "
"software is provided by a third party, please contact them directly. Otherwise, "
"first look to see if the same bug has been submitted by someone else by "
"searching at the <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE bug reporting website</a>"
". If not, take note of the details given above, and include them in your bug "
"report, along with as many other details as you think might help."
msgstr ""
"Ber ni dä bulıp çıqmasa, bet yomğağın yaqşı itep tutırıp, KDE törkemenä şäp "
"yärdäm itep bula. Bu yazılımnı öçençe yaq citeştergän ikän, alar belän turı "
"elemtägä çığası. Bu bet bälki terkälengän dä inde, bonı <a "
"href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE'neñ bet yomğaqları säxifäsendä</a> "
"qarap bula."

#: kio/global.cpp:594
msgid "There may have been a problem with your network connection."
msgstr "Çeltärle totaşu belän qíinlıq bulıp çıqqandır bälki."

#: kio/global.cpp:597
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration. If you have been "
"accessing the Internet with no problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Çeltärle caylawı belän qíinlıq bulıp çıqqandır bälki. Baya päräwez belän "
"totaşqanda uñaysızlıqlar oçralğan bulmasa, qíınlıq säbäbe bonda tügelder."

#: kio/global.cpp:600
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem at some point along the network path between the "
"server and this computer."
msgstr ""
"Ul server belän bu sanaq arasındağı totaşunıñ berär cirendä qíinlıq bulıp "
"çıqqandır bälki."

#: kio/global.cpp:602
msgid "Try again, either now or at a later time."
msgstr "Xäzer ük yä ki beraz soñraq sınap qara."

#: kio/global.cpp:603
msgid "A protocol error or incompatibility may have occurred."
msgstr "Protokol xatası yä ki kileşmäw bulıp çıqqandır bälki."

#: kio/global.cpp:604
msgid "Ensure that the resource exists, and try again."
msgstr "Bu resurs buluın tikşerep, yañadan qılıp qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:605
msgid "The specified resource may not exist."
msgstr "Bu äytelgän çığanaqnıñ bulmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:606
msgid "You may have incorrectly typed the location."
msgstr "Bu urınlaşunıñ yalğış kertelgän buluı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:607
msgid "Double-check that you have entered the correct location and try again."
msgstr ""
"Bu urınlaşunıñ tuğrı kertelgän buluın qabat tikşerep, tağın sınap qararğa bula."

#: kio/global.cpp:609
msgid "Check your network connection status."
msgstr "Çeltärgä totaşu xäläten tikşeräse."

#: kio/global.cpp:613
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Reading"
msgstr "Uqu öçen Resurs Açıp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:614
msgid ""
"This means that the contents of the requested file or folder <strong>%1</strong> "
"could not be retrieved, as read access could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"Soralğan <strong>%1</strong> digän birem/törgäk eçtälegen alıp bulmí dip "
"añlarğa kiräk bonı, säbäbe uqırlıq xoquqlar bulmawında."

#: kio/global.cpp:617
msgid "You may not have permissions to read the file or open the folder."
msgstr "Bu birem uqırlıq yä ki bu törgäk açarlıq xoquqlarnıñ bulmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:623
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Writing"
msgstr "Yazu öçen Resurs Açıp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:624
msgid ""
"This means that the file, <strong>%1</strong>, could not be written to as "
"requested, because access with permission to write could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän biremgä soralğança yazıp bulmí dip añlarğa kiräk "
"bonı, säbäbe yazırlıq xoquqlar citmäwendä."

#: kio/global.cpp:632
msgid "Cannot Initiate the %1 Protocol"
msgstr "%1 Protokolın Caylap Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:633
msgid "Unable to Launch Process"
msgstr "Yök Cibärep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:634
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol could not be started. This is usually due to technical reasons."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolı aşa ireşüne aşıra torğan yazılımnı "
"cibärep bulmadı. Säbäbe eçendäge belän bäyle bula yış."

#: kio/global.cpp:637
msgid ""
"The program which provides compatibility with this protocol may not have been "
"updated with your last update of KDE. This can cause the program to be "
"incompatible with the current version and thus not start."
msgstr ""
"KDE'neñ soñğı yañartılğan çaqta, bu protokolnı eşkärtüçe yazılımnıñ yañartılmí "
"qalğan buluı bar. Şuña säbäple yazılımnar arasında söremnär kileşmäwe bulıp "
"çığuı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:645
msgid "Internal Error"
msgstr "Eçke xata"

#: kio/global.cpp:646
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolı aşa ireşüne aşıra torğan yazılım eçke "
"xata turında belderde."

#: kio/global.cpp:654
msgid "Improperly Formatted URL"
msgstr "Yalğız Tözelgän URL"

#: kio/global.cpp:655
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</strong>"
"ocator (URL) that you entered was not properly formatted. The format of a URL "
"is generally as follows:"
"<blockquote><strong>protocol://user:password@www.example.org:port/folder/filenam"
"e.extension?query=value</strong></blockquote>"
msgstr ""
"Kertelgän <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</strong>"
"ocator (URL) töszeleşe tieşleçä bulmadı. URL tözeleşe bolayraq bulırğa tieş:"
"<blockquote><strong>protokol://qullanuçı:sersüz@www.ürnäk.org:port/yul/biremadı."
"quşımta?soraw=bäyä</strong></blockquote>"

#: kio/global.cpp:664
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Protocol %1"
msgstr "Totılmağan Protokol: %1"

#: kio/global.cpp:665
msgid ""
"The protocol <strong>%1</strong> is not supported by the KDE programs currently "
"installed on this computer."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän protokol, bu sanaqta quyılğan bu KDE-yazılımnar belän "
"totılmí."

#: kio/global.cpp:668
msgid "The requested protocol may not be supported."
msgstr "Bu soralğan protokolnıñ totılmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:669
msgid ""
"The versions of the %1 protocol supported by this computer and the server may "
"be incompatible."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta totılğan %1 protokolınıñ söreme ul serverdäge belän kileşmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:671
msgid ""
"You may perform a search on the Internet for a KDE program (called a kioslave "
"or ioslave) which supports this protocol. Places to search include <a "
"href=\"http://kde-apps.org/\">http://kde-apps.org/</a> "
"and <a href=\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."
msgstr ""
"Bu protokolnı tota torğan KDE-yazılımnarnı päräwez aşa tabıp bula, alar "
"kioslave yä ki ioslave dip atala. Ezläw urınnarına <a "
"href=\"http://kde-apps.org/\">http://kde-apps.org/</a> "
"belän <a href=\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a> kerälär."

#: kio/global.cpp:680
msgid "URL Does Not Refer to a Resource."
msgstr "Resurs belän Bäyle Bulmağan URL/"

#: kio/global.cpp:681
msgid "Protocol is a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Sözgeç Protokol bu."

#: kio/global.cpp:682
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</strong>"
"ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a specific resource."
msgstr ""
"Bu kertelgän <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>"
"L</strong>ocator (URL) kiräk çığanaqqa kürsätmi."

#: kio/global.cpp:685
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol; the protocol "
"specified is only for use in such situations, however this is not one of these "
"situations. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a programming "
"error."
msgstr ""
"KDE ul ber protokol belän ikençe protokol aşa da aralaşa belä; bu protokol andí "
"oçraq öçen kileşä, läkin ul bik kiräk tä tügel. Yazılım eçendäge xata arqasında "
"ğına anıñ kiräk buluı kilep çıqtı."

#: kio/global.cpp:693
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Action: %1"
msgstr "Totılmağan Ğämäl: %1"

#: kio/global.cpp:694
msgid ""
"The requested action is not supported by the KDE program which is implementing "
"the <strong>%1</strong> protocol."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolın aşıra torğan yazılım bu soralğan eşne "
"totmí."

#: kio/global.cpp:697
msgid ""
"This error is very much dependent on the KDE program. The additional "
"information should give you more information than is available to the KDE "
"input/output architecture."
msgstr ""
"Ul xata bu KDE-yazılımğa da bik bäyle. KDE'neñ kertü/çığaru tözeleçe turındağı "
"belän çağıştırğanda, bu östämä belem kübräk äytä ala."

#: kio/global.cpp:700
msgid "Attempt to find another way to accomplish the same outcome."
msgstr "Şul uq çığışnı başqa yul aşa da alıp bula"

#: kio/global.cpp:705
msgid "File Expected"
msgstr "Birem Kötelde"

#: kio/global.cpp:706
msgid ""
"The request expected a file, however the folder <strong>%1</strong> "
"was found instead."
msgstr ""
"Bu soraw berär biremne kötkän, çınbarlıqta isä <strong>%1</strong> "
"digän törgäk tabıldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:708
msgid "This may be an error on the server side."
msgstr "Ul server yağındağı xata buluı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:713
msgid "Folder Expected"
msgstr "Törgäk Kötelde"

#: kio/global.cpp:714
msgid ""
"The request expected a folder, however the file <strong>%1</strong> "
"was found instead."
msgstr ""
"Bu soraw berär törgäkne kötkän, çınbarlıqta isä <strong>%1</strong> "
"digän birem tabıldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:721
msgid "File or Folder Does Not Exist"
msgstr "Andí Birem/Törgäk Yuq Äle"

#: kio/global.cpp:722
msgid "The specified file or folder <strong>%1</strong> does not exist."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän birem/törgäk barlıqta bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:730
msgid ""
"The requested file could not be created because a file with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr "Soralğan adı belän biremneñ bar buluına säbäple, anı yasap bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:732
msgid "Try moving the current file out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Biredäge biremne çitkä küçerep qarap, tağın sınap qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:734
msgid "Delete the current file and try again."
msgstr "Biremne beterep, qabat eşläp qara."

#: kio/global.cpp:735
msgid "Choose an alternate filename for the new file."
msgstr "Bu yaña birem öçen başqa adın saylísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:740
msgid ""
"The requested folder could not be created because a folder with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr "Soralğan adı belän törgäkneñ bar buluına säbäple, anı yasap bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:742
msgid "Try moving the current folder out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Biredäge törgäkne çitkä küçerep qarap, tağın sınap qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:744
msgid "Delete the current folder and try again."
msgstr "Törgäkne beterep, qabat eşläp qara."

#: kio/global.cpp:745
msgid "Choose an alternate name for the new folder."
msgstr "Bu yaña törgäk öçen başqa adın saylísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:749
msgid "Unknown Host"
msgstr "Bilgesez Host"

#: kio/global.cpp:750
msgid ""
"An unknown host error indicates that the server with the requested name, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Serverneñ bilgesez xata äytüençä, soralğan <strong>%1</strong> "
"atlı serverne päräwezdä tabıp bulmí."

#: kio/global.cpp:753
msgid ""
"The name that you typed, %1, may not exist: it may be incorrectly typed."
msgstr "%1 itep kertelgän adıñ barlıqta yuq, yalğış kertelgän buluı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:760
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "İreşü Tıyıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:761
msgid "Access was denied to the specified resource, <strong>%1</strong>."
msgstr "Bu resursqa ireşü tíılğan: <strong>%1</strong>."

#: kio/global.cpp:763 kio/global.cpp:979
msgid "You may have supplied incorrect authentication details or none at all."
msgstr "Tanılu öçen birelgän belemneñ citmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:765 kio/global.cpp:981
msgid "Your account may not have permission to access the specified resource."
msgstr ""
"Xísabıñdağı köyläwlär buyınça bu çığanaqqa ireşü öçen xoquqlar birelmägän."

#: kio/global.cpp:767 kio/global.cpp:983 kio/global.cpp:995
msgid ""
"Retry the request and ensure your authentication details are entered correctly."
msgstr ""
"Tanıtu beleme tuğrı kertelgän buluın tikşerep alıp, qabat sorap qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:773
msgid "Write Access Denied"
msgstr "Yazuğa İreşü Tıyıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:774
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> "
"was rejected."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän biremgä yazu tíılğan dip añlarğa kiräk bonı."

#: kio/global.cpp:781
msgid "Unable to Enter Folder"
msgstr "Törgäkkä Kerep Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:782
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"folder <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän törgäkne açu tíılğan dip añlarğa kiräk bonı."

#: kio/global.cpp:790
msgid "Folder Listing Unavailable"
msgstr "Törgäk Eçtälegen Uqıp Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:791
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "%1 protokolı ul birem sisteme tügel."

#: kio/global.cpp:792
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents of "
"the folder, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to do so."
msgstr ""
"Bu protokol totuçı KDE-yazılım ul törgäk eçtälegen tanıluın teli torğan soraw "
"cibärep anı ala almadı dip añlarğa kiräk bonı."

#: kio/global.cpp:800
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Äylänmä Bäy Tabıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:801
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate name "
"and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that results in an "
"infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Törle UNIX'larda törgäk/biremnärgä qarağan başqa atlı bäylär yasap bula. Benä "
"şul üz-üzenä kürsätkän bäylärdän torğan çiksez äylänmä tabılğan buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:805 kio/global.cpp:827
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite loop, "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Bu äylänmäneñ berär öleşen beterü aşa ul äylänmäne özep qarap, tağın eşläp "
"qaríşı."

#: kio/global.cpp:814
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Sorawnı Qullanuçı Özde"

#: kio/global.cpp:815 kio/global.cpp:1108
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Bu soraw özderelgän bulğaç, anı uzdırıp bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:817 kio/global.cpp:1011 kio/global.cpp:1110
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr "Qabatla bu sorawnı."

#: kio/global.cpp:821
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Küläw Çağında Äylänmä Bäy Tabıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:822
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate name "
"and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE detected a link or "
"series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps "
"in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"Törle UNIX'larda törgäk/biremnärgä qarağan başqa atlı bäylär yasap bula. "
"Soralğan kübäytü eşe eşlängän çaqta, benä şul üz-üzenä kürsätkän bäylärdän "
"toruçı çiksez äylänmä tabılğan buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:832
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Çeltärgä Totaşunı Yasap Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:833
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Soket Yasap Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:834
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Cıhaz xatası çığuına säbäple çeltärle totaşu öçen kiräk bulğan cıhaznı yasap "
"bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:836 kio/global.cpp:949 kio/global.cpp:960 kio/global.cpp:969
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network interface "
"may not be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Bu çeltärle totaşu yalğış caylanğan, yä ki çeltär yözarasınıñ açılmağan buluı "
"bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:842
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "Servergä Totaşu Kire Qağıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:843
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän server bu sanaq belän totaşudan baş tartqan."

#: kio/global.cpp:845
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured to "
"allow requests."
msgstr ""
"Päräwez belän totaşılğan bu server çit sorawlarnı eşkärtü öçen köylänmägän."

#: kio/global.cpp:847
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running the "
"requested service (%1)."
msgstr ""
"Päräwez belän totaşılğan bu serverdä soralğan xezmätne (%1) cibärep bulmí."

#: kio/global.cpp:849
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr ""
"Eçke çeltärne yaqlí torğan utkirtä sineñ sorawlarğa ütärgä birmäweneñ buluı "
"bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:856
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "Servergä Totaşu Kötelmägändä Yazbıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:857
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>"
", the connection was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> belän totaşılu bulsa da, kötelmägän cirdä aralaşu çağında "
"ul totaşu yabılğan buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:860
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the connection "
"as a response to the error."
msgstr ""
"Protokolda, bu servergä totaşılu yabıluına kiterä alğan xata kilep çığuınıñ "
"buluı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:866
msgid "URL Resource Invalid"
msgstr "URL Resursı Yaraqsız"

#: kio/global.cpp:867
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "%1 digäne Sözgeç Protokolı tügel."

#: kio/global.cpp:868
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</strong>"
"ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid mechanism of accessing "
"the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Bu kertelgän <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>"
"L</strong>ocator (URL) ul çığanaqqa ireşü öçen yaraqlı ısulına bäylänmägän, "
"<strong>%1%2</strong>."

#: kio/global.cpp:873
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This request "
"specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not capable of "
"such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a programming "
"error."
msgstr ""
"KDE ul ber protokol belän ikençe protokol aşa da aralaşa belä. Bu protokol andí "
"oçraq öçen kileşä, läkin ul bik kiräk tä tügel. Yazılım eçendäge xata arqasında "
"çıqqan, siräk oşrí torğan xäl der bu."

#: kio/global.cpp:881
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Kereş/Çığış Cıhazın Äzerläp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:882
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "Cıhaznı Bäyläp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:883
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported error "
"was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Soralğan cıhaznı eşkä äzerläp (\"totaştırıp\") bulmadı. Bondí xata kilep çıqtı: "
"<strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/global.cpp:886
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a removable "
"media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral/portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""
"Bu cıhaznıñ äzer bulmawı bar, ü.ö. CD kekebek çığarmalı cıhaz eçendä taşılma "
"tığılmağan bula ala, yä ki totaşmalı cıhaz turı totaşılmağan bula ala."

#: kio/global.cpp:890
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Bu cıhaznı äzerläw (\"totaştıru\") öçen xoquqlar citmi. UNIX asılındağı "
"sistemdä berär cıhaznı eşkä äzerläw öçen idäräçe xoquqları yış kiräk."

#: kio/global.cpp:894
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""
"Bu cıhaznıñ äzer buluın tikşeräse bar; çığarmalı cıhazda taşılma tığılğan, "
"totaşmalı cıhazlar turı totaşılğan bulırğa tieş."

#: kio/global.cpp:900
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Kertü/Çığaru Cıhazın Sütep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:901
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "Cıhaznı Ayırıp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:902
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Soralğan cıhaznı eştän çığarıp (\"ayırıp\") bulmadı. Bondí xata kilep çıqtı: "
"<strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/global.cpp:905
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or user. "
"Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on this device "
"may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""
"Bu cıhaznıñ yöktä buluı bar, yäğni anı başqa qullqnuçı yä ki yazılım qullana "
"ala. Gizgeç täräzäseneñ açıq kileş qalu kebek närsälär dä cıhaznıñ qullanılğan "
"buluına kiterä ala."

#: kio/global.cpp:909
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, system administrator privileges are often required to uninitialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Bu cıhaznı eştän çığaru (\"ayıru\") öçen xoquqlar citmi. UNIX asılındağı "
"sistemdä berär cıhaznı eştän çığaru öçen idäräçe xoquqları yış kiräk."

#: kio/global.cpp:913
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr "Bu cıhaznı qullanğan yazılımnar bulmawın tikşerep, qabat eşläp qara."

#: kio/global.cpp:918
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "Resurs Eçennän Uqıp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:919
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>"
", was able to be opened, an error occurred while reading the contents of the "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaqnı açıp bulsa da, anıñ eçtälegen uqıp bulmağan "
"dip añlarğa kiräk bonı."

#: kio/global.cpp:922
msgid "You may not have permissions to read from the resource."
msgstr "Bu çığanaqtan uqırlıq xoquqlarnıñ citmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:931
msgid "Cannot Write to Resource"
msgstr "Resurs Eçenä Yazıp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:932
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>"
", was able to be opened, an error occurred while writing to the resource."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaqnı açıp bulsa da, anıñ eçenä yazıp bulmağan "
"dip añlarğa kiräk bonı."

#: kio/global.cpp:935
msgid "You may not have permissions to write to the resource."
msgstr "Bu çığanaqqa yazarlıq xoquqlarnıñ citmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:944 kio/global.cpp:955
msgid "Could Not Listen for Network Connections"
msgstr "Çeltärle Totaşularnı Tıñlap Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:945
msgid "Could Not Bind"
msgstr "Bäyläp Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:946 kio/global.cpp:957
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be established to listen for incoming "
"network connections."
msgstr ""
"Cıhaz xatası çığuına säbäple çeltärle totaşu öçen kiräk bulğan cıhaznı, çltärle "
"kerü totaşıluların kötsen itep köyläp bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:956
msgid "Could Not Listen"
msgstr "Tıñlap Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:966
msgid "Could Not Accept Network Connection"
msgstr "Çeltärle Totaşuğa İreşep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:967
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which an error occurred while attempting to "
"accept an incoming network connection."
msgstr ""
"Cıhaz xatası çığuına säbäple, kilgän çeltärle totaşılunı kütärep bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:971
msgid "You may not have permissions to accept the connection."
msgstr "Totaşılunı kütärerlek xoquqlarnıñ citmäwe bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:976
#, c-format
msgid "Could Not Login: %1"
msgstr "Kerep Blmadı: %1"

#: kio/global.cpp:977
msgid ""
"An attempt to login to perform the requested operation was unsuccessful."
msgstr "Soralğan eşne eşläw öçen kerep qaraw unışsız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:988
msgid "Could Not Determine Resource Status"
msgstr "Resurs Xäläten Belep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:989
msgid "Could Not Stat Resource"
msgstr "Resurs Xäläten Belep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:990
msgid ""
"An attempt to determine information about the status of the resource <strong>"
"%1</strong>, such as the resource name, type, size, etc., was unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaq turında adı, töre, küläme, kebek beleşmä alıp "
"qaraw uñışsız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:993
msgid "The specified resource may not have existed or may not be accessible."
msgstr "Soralğan çığanaqnıñ yä bötenläy bulmawı, yä ireşerlek bulmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:1001
msgid "Could Not Cancel Listing"
msgstr "Tezüne Tuqtatıp Bulmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:1002
msgid "FIXME: Document this"
msgstr "TÖZÄTÄSE: İstälek bu"

#: kio/global.cpp:1006
msgid "Could Not Create Folder"
msgstr "Törgäkne Yasap Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1007
msgid "An attempt to create the requested folder failed."
msgstr "Soralğan törgäkne yasap bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1008
msgid "The location where the folder was to be created may not exist."
msgstr "Bu törgäk yasísı bulğan urınlaşu barlıqta yuq."

#: kio/global.cpp:1015
msgid "Could Not Remove Folder"
msgstr "Törgäkne Beterep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1016
msgid "An attempt to remove the specified folder, <strong>%1</strong>, failed."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän törgäk beterep qaraw uñıssız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1018
msgid "The specified folder may not exist."
msgstr "Äytelgän törgäkneñ bulmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:1019
msgid "The specified folder may not be empty."
msgstr "Äytelgän törgäkneñ buş bulmawı bar."

#: kio/global.cpp:1022
msgid "Ensure that the folder exists and is empty, and try again."
msgstr "Bu törgäk buluı belän anıñ buşlığın tikşerep, qabat eşläp qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1027
msgid "Could Not Resume File Transfer"
msgstr "Biremgä Östäp Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1028
msgid ""
"The specified request asked that the transfer of file <strong>%1</strong> "
"be resumed at a certain point of the transfer. This was not possible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän birem taşlu nindider urınnan dawam itelergä tieş dip "
"äytelgän bu sorawda. Läkin anı alay eşläp bulmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1031
msgid "The protocol, or the server, may not support file resuming."
msgstr "Bu protokol mı, yä ki server me birem taşığanda dawam itüen totmí."

#: kio/global.cpp:1033
msgid "Retry the request without attempting to resume transfer."
msgstr "Taşılunı dawam itep qaramíça, bu sorawnı qabatlap qarap bula."

#: kio/global.cpp:1038
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr "Resurs Adın Üzgärtep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1039
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaq adın almaştırıp qaraw uñışsız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1047
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr "Çığanaq Xoquqların Üzgärtep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1048
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource <strong>"
"%1</strong> failed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaqnıñ xoquqlar üzgärtep qaraw uñışsız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1055
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr "Resursnı Beterep Bulmadı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1056
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "<strong>%1</strong> digän çığanaqnı beterep qaraw uñışsız buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1063
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr "Yazılımnıñ Kötelmägän Özelü"

#: kio/global.cpp:1064
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolına ireşüne aşıruçı yazılım kötelmägändä "
"özderelgän buldı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1072
msgid "Out of Memory"
msgstr "Xäter Citmi"

#: kio/global.cpp:1073
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol could not obtain the memory required to continue."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolına ireşüne aşıruçı yazılım üz eşe öçen "
"citärlek xäter ala almí."

#: kio/global.cpp:1081
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr "Proxy Hostı Bilgesez"

#: kio/global.cpp:1082
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, <strong>%1</strong>"
", an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host error indicates that "
"the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%1</strong> digän proxy host turında belem alğanda \"Bilgesez Host\" "
"digän xata kilep çıqtı. Soralğan atamanı päräwezdä tabıp bulmí dip añlarğa "
"kiräk."

#: kio/global.cpp:1086
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no problems "
"recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Çeltär caylawında yalğışlıqlarnıñ buluı bar, proxy host adında bigräk tä. Soñğı "
"arada çeltärgä totaşqanda uñaysızlıqlar kürenmägän çaqta, bu kirenkelek "
"çişeleşe dä bonda tügelder."

#: kio/global.cpp:1090
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr "Proxy caylawın qabat tikşerep, tağın eşläp qarísı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1095
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr "Tanılu Uzmadı: %1 Digän Isul Totılmí"

#: kio/global.cpp:1097
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""
"Tanıtu beleme döres birelgän bula ala, läkin KDE yazılımında %1 protokolınıñ "
"qorıluı bu ısul totmawına säbäple, ul tanılu eşe uzmadı."

#: kio/global.cpp:1101
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> "
"to inform the KDE team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Bet yomğağın <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</a> "
"taba cibärep, KDE törkemen tanıtunıñ totılmağan ısulı turında xäbär it zinhar."

#: kio/global.cpp:1107
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr "Soraw Kire Qağıldı"

#: kio/global.cpp:1114
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr "Serverdä Eçke Xata"

#: kio/global.cpp:1115
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %0."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta <strong>%1</strong> protokolına ireşüne aşıruçı yazılım eçke xata "
"kilep çığu turında belderde: %0."

#: kio/global.cpp:1118
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Server yazılımında bet buluına oşağan bu. Asqaraq äytelgänençä bet yomğağın "
"tutırıp cibär zinhar."

#: kio/global.cpp:1121
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr ""
"Bu kirenkelek turında belderü öçen server idäräçe belän elemtägä çığası."

#: kio/global.cpp:1123
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug report "
"directly to them."
msgstr ""
"Serverdäge yazılım yazuçıları bilgele bulsa, bet yomğağın turıdan alarğa "
"cibäräse."

#: kio/global.cpp:1128
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr "Kiçertterü Xatası"

#: kio/global.cpp:1129
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received within "
"the amount of time allocated for the request as follows:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li>"
