#: rc.cpp:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <i>wallet</i> "
"file on your local hard disk.  The data is only written in encrypted form, "
"presently using the blowfish algorithm with your password as the key.  When a "
"wallet is opened, the wallet manager application will launch and display an "
"icon in the system tray.  You can use this application to manage your wallets.  "
"It even permits you to drag wallets and wallet contents, allowing you to easily "
"copy a wallet to a remote system."
msgstr ""
"KDE'neñ Buqça Sisteme törle saqlísı belemne cirle disk eçendäge <i>buqça</i> "
"biremendä tota.  Ul belem blowfish asılında eşläwçe serläw belän yaqlana, "
"sersüzeñ anıñ açqıçı bulaçaq. Buqça açılğan çaqta, sistem ulağında buqça "
"citäkçe yazılımınıñ tamğası kürsätelä. Anıñ aşa buqçalarnı başqa sanaqqa da "
"küçerep bula."

